@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@userId = 1

### Get portfolio - user with seeded activity (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/portfolio

### Get portfolio - user without activity (200, zero balance and no positions)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/2/portfolio

### Get portfolio - user does not exist (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/999999/portfolio

### Get portfolio - held instrument has no current market data (503)
### This requires removing marketdata for an instrument held by this user.
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/portfolio
